MODEL DISCLAIMER
----------------
The simulation numbers, timings, utilisation figures and throughput shown in this project
are ILLUSTRATIVE and scaled to make the architecture observable. They are a
teaching model, not measurements of any specific Hexagon NPU, Snapdragon
platform, or silicon. Do not cite them as datasheet values.

Optional native arithmetic runs and local-runtime timings are separately labelled
measurements. They are not measurements of the city's synthetic per-engine
utilization, TOPS or power, and do not establish trained-model accuracy.

